---
import BaseLayout from "~/components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "~/data/site";

const updated = "August 2026";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How this site handles your personal information, in line with South Africa's Protection of Personal Information Act."
>
  <section class="container-prose pt-16 pb-8 md:pt-24">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-ruled">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="display-l mt-7">Privacy notice</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-[14px] text-[var(--color-muted)]">Last updated {updated}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="container-prose pb-24">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        This notice explains what personal information this website collects, why,
        and what happens to it. It is written to comply with South Africa's
        Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA).
      </p>

      <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
      <p>
        {site.legal.operator}, {site.location}. The Information Officer is
        {site.legal.informationOfficer}, contactable at
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What is collected</h2>
      <p>
        Only what you type into the contact form: your name, email address,
        optionally your organisation, what your enquiry is about, your message,
        and any times you suggest for a conversation.
      </p>
      <p>
        The site sets <strong>no analytics, advertising or tracking cookies</strong>.
        A single value is stored in your browser's local storage to remember that
        you dismissed the privacy notice. It never leaves your device.
      </p>

      <h2>Why it is collected</h2>
      <p>
        To reply to you. That's the whole purpose. Your details are not sold, not
        shared with third parties for their own purposes, and not added to any
        mailing list without you asking to be on one.
      </p>

      <h2>Who processes it</h2>
      <p>
        Form submissions are delivered by <a href="https://formsubmit.co" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">FormSubmit</a>,
        which forwards the message to my email inbox. Email is hosted by Google
        (Gmail). Both process the data on my behalf in order to deliver and store
        the message.
      </p>

      <h2>How long it is kept</h2>
      <p>
        Enquiry correspondence is kept for as long as it is useful to the working
        relationship, and no longer than three years after our last contact unless
        we have an ongoing engagement or I am required to keep it for longer.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Under POPIA you may ask me to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>confirm what personal information I hold about you;</li>
        <li>correct anything that is wrong;</li>
        <li>delete it, where I have no lawful reason to keep it.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and I will action it.
        You also have the right to complain to the Information Regulator of South
        Africa.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If this notice changes — in particular if analytics are ever added, which
        would require your consent first — the updated date above will change with it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
